{
  "text": "Elon, it is good to have you back. Thanks Joe. Always an adventure. With artificial intelligence, we are summoning the demon. In all those stories where the guy with the pentagram thinks he can control the demon, it never works out. The rate of improvement in digital compute and machine intelligence is exponential. We need regulatory oversight to ensure public safety. Normally regulations take ten years to get enacted, but AI moves in months. If digital superintelligence arrives before safety is solved, human agency is compromised. The bandwidth bottleneck between human thought and digital output is severe. You are typing with your thumbs at maybe twenty words per minute. Direct neural interfaces will allow high-bandwidth symbiosis with digital intelligence. That is the primary mission behind Neuralink.",
